      "instruction": "Read the story carefully and learn the moral lesson.",
      "story_title": "The Thirsty Crow",
      "content": "One hot summer day, a thirsty crow flew all around searching for water. After a long time, he found a pitcher with a little water at the bottom. He could not reach the water. He saw small pebbles on the ground and dropped them one by one into the pitcher. The water level came up, he drank the water happily, and flew away.",
      "moral": "Where there is a will, there is a way."
